sequenceDiagram
    participant Auditor1 as Auditor 1
    participant Auditor2 as Auditor 2 (Reviewer)
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant CR as Collaboration & Review Domain
    participant WAL as Workpaper Authoring & Lifecycle Domain
    participant EB as EventBridge
    participant GAL as Governance, Audit Trail & Lineage
    participant DB as DynamoDB

    Auditor1->>UI: Edit Workpaper Section (Parallel Editing)
    UI->>WAL: Submit Edits (workpaperId, updates)
    WAL->>DB: Create New Immutable Version
    DB-->>WAL: Version Confirmed
    WAL->>EB: Emit VersionUpdated Event
    EB->>GAL: Log Edit Event (User, Timestamp, Changes)
    EB->>CR: Notify for Presence Update
    CR-->>UI: Show Presence (Auditor2 Sees Auditor1 Editing)

    Auditor1->>UI: Assign Review to Auditor2
    UI->>CR: Create Review Assignment (workpaperId, reviewer: Auditor2, state: In Review)
    CR->>DB: Store Assignment Metadata
    DB-->>CR: Confirmed
    CR->>EB: Emit ReviewAssigned Event
    EB->>GAL: Log Assignment Event
    EB->>UI: Send Notification to Auditor2 (In-App/Email)

    Auditor2->>UI: Add Threaded Comment (Anchored to Section/Field)
    UI->>CR: Post Comment (workpaperId, section, commentText)
    CR->>DB: Store Comment
    DB-->>CR: Confirmed
    CR->>EB: Emit CommentAdded Event
    EB->>GAL: Log Comment Event
    EB->>UI: Notify Auditor1 (Mention/Change)

    Auditor1->>UI: Resolve Comment & Make Changes
    UI->>CR: Update Comment State (Resolved)
    CR->>EB: Emit CommentResolved Event
    EB->>GAL: Log Resolution
    UI->>WAL: Submit Rework Edits
    WAL->>DB: Create Rework Version
    WAL->>EB: Emit ReworkVersionUpdated Event
    EB->>GAL: Log Rework

    Auditor2->>UI: Approve Workpaper
    UI->>CR: Update Review State (Approved)
    CR->>WAL: Transition Lifecycle State (to Approved)
    WAL->>EB: Emit StateChanged Event (Approved)
    EB->>GAL: Log Approval
    EB->>UI: Notify Auditor1 (Approval)
    Note over CR,GAL: All Interactions Logged&#59; Supports Reconstruction & QA